{"id":"wb-6-648","name":"福胜寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"福胜寺塔","text":"福胜寺塔又称梵塔，位于河南省邓州市城区大十字街西南角，始建于北宋天圣十年（1032年）二月二十五日，该塔为八角椎形、仿楼阁式、密檐浮雕的砖塔。塔原为十三层，元末遭兵毁，变为七层，明代洪武初由僧子颜重修，2006年，福胜寺塔被列为为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A6%8F%E8%83%9C%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94412141,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94412141","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4a81c880c1292bcc27a31462.jpg","title":"20260904_Fusheng_Temple_Pagoda_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260904_Fusheng_Temple_Pagoda_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/20260904_Fusheng_Temple_Pagoda_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南邓州 福胜寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}